// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Source File : texts/Working 	Sheet : Ann-Marie_Engles 
//
// Script      : Xlstocontactdef.bat 
// Version     : 31 
// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Dr. Ann-Marie Engles 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P2873900559" "Dr. Ann-Marie Engles"
// ProfessionString :
"P3918021505" "Scientist and Engineer"
// DescriptionString :
"P1465852037" "Dr. Engles moved to Paragon City just before the Rikti Invasion. Already famous for her work with microelectronics and molecular machines, she became the toast of the scientific community when, with the help of anonymous investors, she set up Engles Electronics, a research company focused chiefly on robotics. During the Rikti Invasion, she volunteered her time and expertise to help repair electronics and other equipment damaged during the attack. She also provided similar services for a number of Paragon City's gadget-oriented heroes. She is currently involved in a new robotics project that is somehow related to recovered Rikti technology. Dr. Engles keeps a tight lid on her discoveries, but is otherwise quite open with her knowledge and expertise. Villains have raided her labs on several occasions, but the city's heroes have always come to her rescue, something she's very grateful for."
// WrongAllianceString :
"P2795972436" "I don't talk to villains, {HeroName}."
// HelloString :
"P2348168936" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>Ready to assist?</A>"
// HelloString :
"P2107650913" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>There has been a great deal of activity of late.</A>"
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P48762768" "Please call and make an appointment; I'm quite busy. I believe {LastContactName} has less stringent office policies."
// FirstVisitString :
"P2816046359" "I can be of great help to you, {HeroName}."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P1889672145" "I've been spending so much time in the lab I haven't had a chance to listen for rumors. Why not talk to one of your other contacts?"
// PlayerBusyString :
"P1250224990" "With that workload, you'll be up all night!"
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P1437442222" "This next mission is a little risky. I'd feel better if you reached Security Level {Level} first."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P2972849370" "My friend, you have impressed me with your commitment to Paragon City. My lab techs have developed a number of <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>gadgets</A> that I think you might find quite intriguing. And, please, don't hesitate to call the lab. I'll always make time to talk to you."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P2462337322" "I believe the time has come to trust you with all I know. You should take a look at the <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>latest technology</A> in my store."
// FailsafeLevelString :
"P1710321946" "I believe you're ready to move on to a more advanced field of study."
// LocationString :
"P970836190" "Skyway City"
// IntroString :
"P1142603202" "Dr. Ann-Marie Engles is a real expert in the field of cybernetics. She is fascinated with the technical aspect of the Vahzilok and the social impact of the Outcasts. Dr. Engles has set up shop in Skyway City."
// IntroAcceptString :
"P3071407447" "Choose Dr. Engles"
// IntroSendoffString :
"P1649967171" "You'll learn a lot from Dr. Engles; she's always happy to lend heroes a hand."
// IntroduceOneContact :
"P2704943133" "An <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_INTRODUCE>associate</A> of mine would enjoy making your acquaintance."
// IntroduceTwoContacts :
"P1564664231" "Several of my <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_INTRODUCE>colleagues</A> have expressed an interest in getting to know you."
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


