// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Source File : texts/Working 	Sheet : Cho_Ge 
//
// Script      : Xlstocontactdef.bat 
// Version     : 31 
// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Cho Ge 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P1218709581" "Cho Ge"
// ProfessionString :
"P184561514" "Reformed Gangster"
// DescriptionString :
"P3411028922" "The Tsoo are a relatively new group in Paragon City, the only ethnically Hmong gang the region has ever seen. Cho Ge was a gangster years before they came on the scene, a hired gun for the Chinese Triads. When the Tsoo ousted the Triads, Cho Ge saw the writing on the wall. He left his old friends and tried to join the Tsoo, but once he understood that they were more like a cult than a gang, he decided to turn over a new leaf. He ratted them out to the police. Now, he's ostensibly a reformed gang member and an informant for those in the city who fight crime. Whether or not his conversion is complete is unclear, but he certainly seems eager and ready to help the forces of good. Then again, he's always known how to pick a winning team."
// WrongAllianceString :
// HelloString :
"P356560428" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>Got some hot leads.</A>"
// HelloString :
"P590926839" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>You will want to hear this.</A>"
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P3831463485" "Nah, not now. If you're so lonely, go see {LastContactName}."
// FirstVisitString :
"P3143193719" "You want solid info, you've come to the right place."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P3346010875" "I got no more jobs for you, {HeroName}. Try someone else."
// PlayerBusyString :
"P834185160" "Aren't you the busy bee? I can't give you any more work."
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P1596999845" "I've got a tip, but it's a touchy situation. Get to Security Level {Level}; then we'll chat."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P2088965000" "You're pretty slick, hero. Let's be friends. I'll bet you could use some <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>new Enhancements.</A> Just don't forget where you got them. Call me, {HeroName}; I want you to know you can rely on me."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P4253452835" "You would have made a heck of a gang leader, {HeroName}. Of course, I'm glad you're one of the good guys. I can trick you out with some pretty <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>slick Enhancements</A>, if you're interested."
// FailsafeLevelString :
"P3204497661" "I have nothing more for you."
// LocationString :
// IntroString :
"P704318588" "I know this guy, his name's Cho Ge. He's a little shady. He even used to be a gangster, but these days he's working for the good guys. He knows everything about the Tsoo and the Council. Cho Ge hangs out in Skyway City nowadays."
// IntroAcceptString :
"P1736816226" "Choose Cho Ge"
// IntroSendoffString :
"P1343899303" "As long as you watch your step with Cho Ge, you will benefit from his knowledge."
// IntroduceOneContact :
"P1394943808" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_INTRODUCE>Somebody</A> I know wants to meet ya."
// IntroduceTwoContacts :
"P287255615" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_INTRODUCE>Couple people</A> I know want to talk with you."
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


