// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Source File : texts/Working 	Sheet : Colleen_Saramago 
//
// Script      : Xlstocontactdef.bat 
// Version     : 31 
// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Colleen Saramago 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P1884236707" "Colleen Saramago"
// ProfessionString :
"P446751775" "Hero Corps Rep"
// DescriptionString :
"P2175412950" "Hero Corps is a corporation that brokers work for qualified heroes and helps governments around the world deal with super-powered problems. Colleen Saramago is a young, inexperienced Hero Corps liaison, but she's already established a successful client list. Her current task is combating two of the city's insidious threats: the Clockwork and the Trolls. She's well aware that every time she gives a hero an assignment she's putting a life on the line, so she goes the extra mile to give her heroes all the support she can."
// WrongAllianceString :
// HelloString :
"P98535958" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>Hero Corps has us all working overtime.</A>"
// HelloString :
"P3348465571" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>I can get you the best assignments!</A>"
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P2624579942" "I'm sorry, but I don't have any assignments right now. If I were you, I'd talk to {LastContactName}."
// FirstVisitString :
"P1318159636" "I can help you get the prime jobs, {HeroName}!"
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P3978625260" "Hero Corps hasn't authorized me to handle a hero of your stature. I'm sure one of your other contacts can use a hand."
// PlayerBusyString :
"P2598701548" "Hero Corps would have my head if I gave you another case! You already have too many!"
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P3281339821" "Come back around when you reach Security Level {Level}. I've got an assignment I'd love to hand you."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P1550687099" "My friend, your Hero Corps status has been upgraded. You're now eligible for some more <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>powerful objects</A> from the store. Don't forget to call in regularly for new leads."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P3196841654" "I have been authorized to trust you with our best assignments. You'll need our <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>best gear</A> if you're going to tackle these."
// FailsafeLevelString :
"P3194370868" "You need to find a higher clearance Hero Corps representative."
// LocationString :
"P3493519327" "Steel Canyon"
// IntroString :
"P2097771300" "Do you have any contacts with Hero Corps yet? Even if you do, you should really talk to Colleen Saramago. I think she'd be happy to give you some assignments dealing with the Clockwork and the Trolls. Hero Corps has stationed Colleen in Steel Canyon."
// IntroAcceptString :
"P3903682231" "Choose Colleen Saramago"
// IntroSendoffString :
"P728145873" "Hero Corps has a very good information network."
// IntroduceOneContact :
"P3501312816" "Here's <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_INTRODUCE>someone</A> you should meet."
// IntroduceTwoContacts :
"P2328486748" "You should meet these <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_INTRODUCE>people</A>."
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


