// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Fareed Abdullah 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P1809610764" "Fareed Abdullah"
// ProfessionString :
"P880279185" "Technology Analyst"
// DescriptionString :
"P2108893179" "Fareed Abdullah is an independent technology analyst. Companies call him in to evaluate new technologies and help them make the right decisions. In order to do the best job possible, Fareed keeps himself constantly apprised of the latest developments in technology. In Paragon City, that means trying to keep up with what the bad guys are doing and what the heroes are doing in response. Fareed has analyzed hundreds of pieces of criminal equipment and advised nearly as many heroes on the technology that can serve them best. He's very well connected and popular in the science community, and he's always looking for new heroes to work with."
// WrongAllianceString :
// HelloString :
"P2183235176" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>Hello, ready to do some good?</A>"
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P2703051613" "I'm sorry, but I have a previous appointment. I believe {LastContactName} was looking for you, though."
// FirstVisitString :
"P2749696706" "I believe that we can assist each other a great deal."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P313482698" "You should talk to your other contacts. I don't have any more work for you."
// PlayerBusyString :
"P3607752243" "You're a little too busy to be looking for more work, {HeroName}."
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P3684134630" "I'd like to see you when you reach Security Level {Level}. I have a mission that requires a delicate touch."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P1977843482" "It is time for us to begin trusting each other more, friend. I think I can trust you with the <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>latest tech</A> in my store. I'm happy to take your call, day or night."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P198174116" "Now is the time for us to fully trust each other. Take a look at these <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>nifty gadgets.</A>"
// FailsafeLevelString :
"P2704248822" "I am afraid that we can help each other no further."
// LocationString :
// IntroString :
"P1167768926" "There's a technology expert named Fareed Abdullah you should talk to. He's a very interesting guy and knows a great deal about the Clockwork and the Lost. Fareed deals with folks out of Steel Canyon these days."
// IntroAcceptString :
"P1681449434" "Choose Fareed Abdullah"
// IntroSendoffString :
"P1897165085" "Fareed is very kind and courteous."
// IntroduceOneContact :
"P1379125767" "I would like you to meet <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_INTRODUCE>someone.</A>"
// IntroduceTwoContacts :
"P509343679" "There are <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_INTRODUCE>some people</A> I want you to meet."
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


