// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Guy Denson 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P1497406555" "Guy Denson"
// ProfessionString :
"P2286191494" "Courier"
// DescriptionString :
"P2619879676" "Guy Denson knows how to get around the city, fast. This is an important skill in a place that serves as a stage for conflicts between costumed heroes and vast criminal conspiracies. It's no wonder traffic is so bad. Guy Denson knows how to cut through the tangles and troubles and deliver a package safely and on time. One of Guy's secrets is the network of couriers and clients he has developed, all of whom keep him abreast of the latest happenings on the streets of Paragon City. He also has numerous friends and clients who are heroes. He likes to pass on whatever he knows to helpful heroes, especially when it's information about the Clockwork."
// WrongAllianceString :
// HelloString :
"P3269555388" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>You ready to get moving?</A>"
// HelloString :
"P2022445748" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>Things are jumpin' in Paragon City.</A>"
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P2910051622" "Sorry, gotta fly. Go see {LastContactName} if you need a job."
// FirstVisitString :
"P2862358527" "I hope you can keep up with me, {HeroName}. I know a lot of things you could help with."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P2585694234" "Ask your other contacts, {HeroName}. Things are quiet on my route."
// PlayerBusyString :
"P482936369" "A little advice, {HeroName}. Never take on more jobs than you can handle."
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P4165247670" "I'd like to give you this job, but it might be best to wait until you reach Security Level {Level}."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P3411344209" "You move like you have a purpose, my friend. Why not take a look at my <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>latest Enhancements?</A> Call me if you need a hand."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P1791260931" "You can work my routes anytime, {HeroName}. Have I got the <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>Enhancements</A> for you!"
// FailsafeLevelString :
"P4275899124" "You need to move on, {HeroName}."
// LocationString :
// IntroString :
"P136630756" "I know a courier named Guy Denson who would like to meet you. He runs all over town delivering important packages, and he's helped lots of heroes with the Clockwork and the Lost. Guy's routes have him in Steel Canyon now."
// IntroAcceptString :
"P3778909077" "Choose Guy Denson"
// IntroSendoffString :
"P2801177803" "Guy will steer you to the heart of trouble."
// IntroduceOneContact :
"P477537490" "My <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_INTRODUCE>buddy</A> wants to meet you."
// IntroduceTwoContacts :
"P467349022" "Some <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_INTRODUCE>pals</A> of mine are looking to get to know you better."
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


