// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Source File : texts/Working 	Sheet : Jake_Montoya 
//
// Script      : Xlstocontactdef.bat 
// Version     : 31 
// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Jake Montoya 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P1874641281" "Jake Montoya"
// ProfessionString :
"P2107630620" "Retired Hero"
// DescriptionString :
"P3904489737" "Jake Montoya was once a well-known hero who fought under the name Red Tiger. After a nearly fatal injury cost him his leg, he chose early retirement and a prosthetic limb over a cybernetic replacement. But retirement from active duty doesn't mean he's turned his back on the city. Now he's one of many retired heroes who acts as a clearing house for information. He uses his experience and contacts to keep tabs on various villain groups, then organizes active heroes to deal with the situation. He's particularly interested in the Clockwork King, largely because he lost his leg while fighting him."
// WrongAllianceString :
// HelloString :
"P3392593254" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>I've got some work, if you're up for it.</A>"
// HelloString :
"P1182023482" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>Time to get it done.</A>"
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P3360892747" "Sorry, man, I'm loaded up here. Go see if {LastContactName} has something for you."
// FirstVisitString :
"P2430974199" "I have heard of you, {HeroName}. You sound like an up-and-comer to me. Prove me right."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P2281246193" "Sorry, {HeroName}, but I have nothing to challenge you. You should apply your skills to some of your other contacts' troubles."
// PlayerBusyString :
"P2801137123" "A good hero never takes on too much work. You need to finish some of your missions, {HeroName}."
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P1198648811" "I'm not sure you're ready for this mission. Get your clearance to Security Level {Level}; then we'll talk."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P1521346430" "So far it looks to me like you've got the goods. I think I can start calling you a friend. I have some <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>equipment</A> left over from my days as Red Tiger. I think you might find it useful. If there's anything else I can do for you, just call."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P759627543" "You've sold me, {HeroName}. You are definitely a hero I can believe in. I'd be proud if you'd make use of all my old <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>equipment.</A>"
// FailsafeLevelString :
"P3379292738" "I need to work with some of the newer, less experienced heroes from now on."
// LocationString :
// IntroString :
"P711814251" "Did you ever hear of the Red Tiger? He retired right after the war, and now he's just Jake Montoya. He may not wear a costume anymore, but he can sure help those who do, especially with information on the Clockwork and the Trolls. Jake has retired to Skyway City."
// IntroAcceptString :
"P3054690415" "Choose Jake Montoya"
// IntroSendoffString :
"P2219090639" "Jake has his eye out for new blood to take up the mantle of heroism."
// IntroduceOneContact :
"P550757551" "I want you to work with <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_INTRODUCE>someone</A> I know, if you are willing."
// IntroduceTwoContacts :
"P393937057" "These <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_INTRODUCE>contacts</A> could prove useful to you."
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


