// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Juliana Nehring 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P2459230521" "Juliana Nehring"
// ProfessionString :
"P2558379567" "Reporter"
// DescriptionString :
"P2544300143" "Juliana Nehring is one of the city's most prolific and popular Internet reporters. She runs an independent news site that features articles about the subjects that most interest her. Her daring approach to journalism has won her national acclaim, although some criticize her for putting too much of herself in the story. She has gone undercover on numerous occasions and risked death more than once. Lately she's been focusing most of her attention on the villains that threaten the city. She's particularly interested in Vahzilok because he, like her, uses the Internet to spread his message."
// WrongAllianceString :
// HelloString :
"P1472010078" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>Have I got a story for you!</A>"
// HelloString :
"P2516102550" "<A HREF={ACCEPT}>Let's make some news.</A>"
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P1968399888" "No time, maybe later. See {LastContactName} if you want a story."
// FirstVisitString :
"P4189743916" "I hope you can help me increase my readership."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P762229937" "My stories aren't in your league, {HeroName}. You'll have to check with one of your other sources."
// PlayerBusyString :
"P1493107463" "You've got to resist the impulse to take on too much work. Take it from someone who knows."
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P2663137215" "Talk to me again when you reach Security Level {Level}. I may have a lead for you then."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P1390868458" "With the kind of material you are providing me I think it's time for us to share a little more. Friends like you deserve to know exactly what <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>Enhancements</A> I have. Call me at any hour."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P1210238128" "You have rapidly gone from watching the news to making it! You have my full support. Let me suit you up with the very <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>best Enhancements</A> in my store."
// FailsafeLevelString :
"P1673814552" "I'm moving on to other stories, but I will always remember you fondly."
// LocationString :
// IntroString :
"P714234343" "Have you ever read Juliana Nehring's column? She's an Internet reporter who specializes in super-powered villains. She's always looking for new sources to help her investigate the latest Vahzilok and Outcast activities. Juliana files her stories in Skyway City."
// IntroAcceptString :
"P846359904" "Choose Juliana Nehring"
// IntroSendoffString :
"P2346593361" "Juliana is tough as nails and is willing to do whatever it takes to get a story."
// IntroduceOneContact :
"P3695794351" "You need to meet a <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_INTRODUCE>friend</A> of mine."
// IntroduceTwoContacts :
"P2288011495" "I have some <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_INTRODUCE>people</A> for you to meet."
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


