// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Source File : texts/Working 	Sheet : Karen_Parker 
//
// Script      : Xlstocontactdef.bat 
// Version     : 31 
// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Karen Parker 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P3456307996" "Karen Parker"
// ProfessionString :
"P1268408948" "Police Detective"
// DescriptionString :
"P1588504917" "Paragon City is not known for attracting the best police officers in the world. With so many super-powered heroes breaking cases, it's tough for a good cop to make a real impression. Detective Karen Parker is an exception.  She's got a first-rate investigative mind and has broken a number of high profile cases that even the best heroes couldn't solve. She attributes her successes to her lack of special powers, since it means she must rely on her wits. She has mixed feelings about the city's heroes. As a realist, she knows they're vital to the city's welfare, but she sometimes wishes they behaved a little more responsibly. Still, once a hero earns her respect, she has no qualms about working with him or her to solve crimes. For Karen, the most important thing is getting the criminals off the streets and making the case stick in court."
// WrongAllianceString :
// HelloString :
"P1823637001" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>Got some leads for ya.</A>"
// HelloString :
"P2577843368" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>There's work to do.</A>"
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P2906221736" "I'm kind of busy here. I think {LastContactName} may need you."
// FirstVisitString :
"P3533030516" "You may have heard that I am not too happy with some of the heroes in this town. That's true, but I base my judgments of people on their actions."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P3152568693" "My cases are small potatoes for you these days. You should help somebody else."
// PlayerBusyString :
"P1377141844" "You've got a number of outstanding cases already."
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P2400434307" "The department wants only the best heroes on this one. Better get yourself to Security Level {Level} first."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P4273616170" "You seem trustworthy, {HeroName}. I think we can be true friends. On my beat, I've learned that <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>good equipment</A> can often mean the difference between life and death. You should buy some. Just be sure to radio in if you need a hand."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P4094627658" "If every hero in this town had your attitude, I'd be a lot less of a sourpuss. Kid, I think I can trust you with my <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>best Enhancements.</A>"
// FailsafeLevelString :
"P4215432358" "I got no more assignments for you, {HeroName}. Keep up the good work out there."
// LocationString :
// IntroString :
"P1806522957" "Detective Karen Parker has a great reputation as a tough but fair-minded cop. If you're respectful and show her you're competent, I'm sure she'll be happy to work with you on the Tsoo and the Council. Detective Parker investigates crime out of the Skyway City precinct."
// IntroAcceptString :
"P940421188" "Choose Karen Parker"
// IntroSendoffString :
"P2114213089" "Detective Parker can be harsh, but only when it's warranted."
// IntroduceOneContact :
"P2028811643" "Got a new <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_INTRODUCE>contact</A> for you."
// IntroduceTwoContacts :
"P4189006720" "I've got some new <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_INTRODUCE>sources</A> for you."
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


