// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Kong Bao 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P117450774" "Kong Bao"
// ProfessionString :
"P1508705982" "Community Leader"
// DescriptionString :
"P1646075299" "Kong Bao is one of the oldest and most respected members of Paragon City's Hmong community. He is considered by many to be the community's leader, a role he takes seriously. He organizes charity events, cultural festivals, and programs designed to keep the Hmong youth in school and off drugs. The recent and terrifying rise of the Tsoo is of particular concern to Mr. Kong. He has redoubled his efforts to curtail the gang's recruiting among Hmong youth, with some success. More and more of the Tsoo's new members come from other ethnic groups. Kong Bao has found that the city's heroes play a crucial role in his efforts, so he is always pleased to work with them."
// WrongAllianceString :
// HelloString :
"P1905832996" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>Greetings. It is urgent that I speak with you.</A>"
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P1174926206" "I'm so sorry, but I must excuse myself; I have a previous engagement. I believe you should speak with {LastContactName} instead."
// FirstVisitString :
"P2420018725" "My community needs me, but all of Paragon City needs ones like yourself, {HeroName}. I am pleased to work with you."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P64375973" "I am sorry, but I have nothing for you. You should speak with your other contacts."
// PlayerBusyString :
"P564341671" "I cannot give you another task when you already have so many."
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P1989859272" "My next task requires a delicate touch. I would feel better if you reached Security Level {Level} first."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P3148253035" "You are a friend to the community, {HeroName}. I would be happy to provide you with any <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>Enhancements</A> you may need. Please telephone whenever you can."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P1747473368" "You are the best I know, {HeroName}. Please do not hesitate to ask me for <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>new Enhancements.</A>"
// FailsafeLevelString :
"P949222838" "You must choose more difficult tasks than the ones I could set before you."
// LocationString :
// IntroString :
"P3839347378" "There's a Hmong businessman named Kong Bao who's a real leader in his community. You should talk to him. I'm sure you'd find him quite helpful, especially when it comes to the Tsoo and the Circle of Thorns. Mr. Kong has strong ties to Skyway City."
// IntroAcceptString :
"P1644808520" "Choose Kong Bao"
// IntroSendoffString :
"P2370941381" "You will be helping a great man, {HeroName}."
// IntroduceOneContact :
"P600062798" "You must meet my <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_INTRODUCE>friend.</A>"
// IntroduceTwoContacts :
"P3104785147" "If you are amenable, there are some more <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_INTRODUCE>friends</A> I wish you to meet."
