// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Mark Freeman 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P994528332" "Mark Freeman"
// ProfessionString :
"P3741152103" "Hacker"
// DescriptionString :
"P1668211013" "There are a lot of hackers in the world, but very few like Mark Freeman. Mark is a mutant, with the power to communicate directly with computers, and this makes him the most talented hacker on the planet. This amazing power has proven useful in several situations, but Mark has also made the government a bit wary of his powers. Mark uses his abilities to feed his own curiosity and, occasionally, to help heroes in need. He has taken a particular interest in the Lost and, like any tech geek, he's curious about the Clockwork King and how his technology actually works."
// WrongAllianceString :
// HelloString :
"P1185591613" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>Bad news on the 'Net today.</A>"
// HelloString :
"P2332386512" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>I have seen some interesting things lately.</A>"
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P1207510193" "Can't talk. Coding. You should interface with {LastContactName}."
// FirstVisitString :
"P1346285119" "Let's find you something to do."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P4099897678" "Sorry, {HeroName}, but it's smooth sailing around here. Maybe one of your other contacts can use a hand."
// PlayerBusyString :
"P1809526196" "Looks like you're going to be burning the midnight oil as it is. I'm not adding to that workload."
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P4291972873" "I've got some secrets for you, {HeroName}, but they'll have to wait until you hit Security Level {Level}."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P832520583" "I think it's time to open your mind to some more possibilities, my friend. I've got some <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>new programs</A> I've been dying to let you try out. Let's stay in touch."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P2903725777" "Time to get you fully jacked into my world. I've got some <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>kickin' software</A> for you."
// FailsafeLevelString :
"P514145281" "You need to interface with some new connections."
// LocationString :
// IntroString :
"P1526946832" "Mark Freeman is a mutant with the ability to communicate with machines. He has been focusing his attention on the Clockwork activity lately, although he's also interested in the mysterious Lost. Mark makes his home in Skyway City."
// IntroAcceptString :
"P1402185199" "Choose Mark Freeman"
// IntroSendoffString :
"P1044025810" "Mark can be a little brusque, but he has a connection that no one else can possibly match."
// IntroduceOneContact :
"P1199828242" "Here is <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_INTRODUCE>someone else</A> for you to talk to."
// IntroduceTwoContacts :
"P4000605261" "Here are some <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_INTRODUCE>others</A> for you to connect with."
