// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Pavel Garnier 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P739888444" "Pavel Garnier"
// ProfessionString :
"P273438047" "FBI Agent"
// DescriptionString :
"P1757242204" "The FBI has several hundred agents in Paragon City, but only an elite few work closely with the local heroes. Pavel Garnier is one of those few. The Rikti targeted all of the nation's intelligence gathering networks during their attack, so the FBI is still woefully undermanned. Agent Garnier's chief areas of concern are information and Internet related crimes, particularly the use of the Internet to coordinate organized crime and terrorism. Most recently he has come up against Vahzilok, who makes use of the Internet to spread his ideology and the plans for his zombie-like creations."
// WrongAllianceString :
// HelloString :
"P3318666783" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>The bureau could really use your help.</A>"
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P1319417688" "I'm right in the middle of a situation here. Try {LastContactName}."
// FirstVisitString :
"P3082661742" "I've got a lot of info for you, {HeroName}."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P547761973" "I can handle things around here, {HeroName}. You should help one of your other contacts."
// PlayerBusyString :
"P841543978" "I can't in good conscience give you another assignment. You already have too many."
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P1226642286" "I have an assignment, but I think the bureau wants to give it to a hero with Security Level {Level} or higher."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P4133573319" "I have some more files I can open up to you, my friend. The bureau has recently provided me with some <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>new Enhancements</A> that you might find helpful. It's important that you call in any problems."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P697564297" "I can share all my case files with you at this point. I think these <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>new Enhancements</A> should help solve some of the tougher ones."
// FailsafeLevelString :
"P3929834342" "Time for you to move on."
// LocationString :
// IntroString :
"P4146885117" "Agent Pavel Garnier from the FBI asked me to send you to him. He thinks you could help him with some of his cases involving the Vahzilok and the Outcasts. Pavel is currently looking into something in Skyway City."
// IntroAcceptString :
"P252193480" "Choose Pavel Garnier"
// IntroSendoffString :
"P3379124894" "A positive connection with the FBI is a very good thing to have."
// IntroduceOneContact :
"P4079856782" "I know <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_INTRODUCE>someone</A> who could be useful to you."
// IntroduceTwoContacts :
"P1154885593" "There are a couple <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_INTRODUCE>friends</A> of mine who you should meet."
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


