// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Thao Ku 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P1659466712" "Thao Ku"
// ProfessionString :
"P3624293717" "Martial Arts Instructor"
// DescriptionString :
"P4221996233" "Thao Ku is one of the most respected martial artists in Paragon City. Its not just for his kickboxing skills that are impressive, but also his role as a community leader and youth organizer. Ethnically Hmong, he emigrated from Laos. He has taught in the same dojo for over twenty years, mentoring thousands of dedicated students in both the physical and spiritual aspects of the martial arts. He has a reputation as a wise man, someone whose body and mind have nearly transcended the limits of human understanding. Master Thao is particularly interested in the mystical side of martial arts, and he is rumored to have some supernatural abilities of his own. He's worked with heroes and law enforcement on numerous occasions, such as during the Rikti War, when he opened his school to serve as a shelter and clinic."
// WrongAllianceString :
// HelloString :
"P228478970" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>There is much for you to do.</A>"
// HelloString :
"P2857023224" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>You must prepare yourself, mentally and physically, for the trouble ahead.</A>"
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P1395902819" "I'm sorry, but I have no time at the moment. {LastContactName} always has time for heroes, though."
// FirstVisitString :
"P2434645309" "Your path will be difficult, {HeroName}. Prepare yourself well."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P917448505" "Your path and mine have diverged, {HeroName}. I hope your other contacts will guide you well."
// PlayerBusyString :
"P2303088628" "You must focus your energy on completing your remaining tasks."
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P1716141007" "Please see me when you reach Security Level {Level}. I am sure we will have grave matters to discuss."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P2493474908" "Your skills are impressive, my friend. But perhaps you could use a little <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>extra kick</A> from my store. If you need anything else, call."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P2303564061" "I am proud to know you, {HeroName}. If I can provide you with <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>new Enhancements</A>, it would be my honor."
// FailsafeLevelString :
"P2224832444" "Your path lies elsewhere."
// LocationString :
// IntroString :
"P4191223549" "Have you ever heard of Master Thao Ku? He's an amazing martial arts teacher, as well as an truly enlightened person. You should meet with him sometime and discuss the Tsoo or the Circle of Thorns. Master Thao has his dojo in Skyway City."
// IntroAcceptString :
"P1227374054" "Choose Master Thao"
// IntroSendoffString :
"P2568624579" "Well done, {HeroName}. Master Thao will steer you straight."
// IntroduceOneContact :
"P3474651290" "There is <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_INTRODUCE>someone</A> you should meet."
// IntroduceTwoContacts :
"P3109259430" "I will introduce you to <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_INTRODUCE>others</A> you may assist."
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


