// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Tom Bowden 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P112783192" "Tom Bowden"
// ProfessionString :
"P276201093" "NSA Field Agent"
// DescriptionString :
"P3011790809" "Agent Tom Bowden recently joined the NSA, after serving as a cryptographer for the Air Force. He specializes in breaking codes, but his duties in Paragon City often involve chasing down radio and satellite intercepts. He's particularly concerned with any kind of propaganda being broadcast by criminals, as well as anything the might put the nation's communications network at risk. For reasons still unclear even to him, he's been given the Clockwork King as his primary assignment, although he hopes to move on to bigger and badder opponents. He's quite curious about the Lost, and he often spends his free time tracking their movements."
// WrongAllianceString :
// HelloString :
"P2214773173" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>I've got something to talk to you about.</A>"
// HelloString :
"P4282892233" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>Full agenda today, {HeroName}.</A>"
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P1446742226" "Not right now, I'm about to start a phone conference with D.C. Don't spread it around, but I know {LastContactName} has a hot lead."
// FirstVisitString :
"P1766351847" "I hope you are ready to help me get the Clockwork off my plate. I've got bigger fish to fry."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P2648718961" "My desk is clean as a whistle thanks to you, {HeroName}. Maybe one of your other contacts has a case."
// PlayerBusyString :
"P2782767187" "I can't give you another job when you already have so much to do."
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P2639573947" "The NSA has classified my next mission Security Level {Level}."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P1387884891" "We are making good progress, thanks to you. My friend, the agency has some <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>more Enhancements</A> for you to peruse. Call me on my direct line."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P2627528944" "You have my full endorsement, {HeroName}. The agency's <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>latest technology</A> is now available to you."
// FailsafeLevelString :
"P3615102012" "I am working with other agents now. You need a new source."
// LocationString :
// IntroString :
"P3098157229" "You should meet Tom Bowden. He's an NSA agent recently assigned to Paragon City. His first assignment is trying to crack the Clockwork puzzle, but he also has a chip on his shoulder for the Lost. Tom's government connections have him in Steel Canyon these days."
// IntroAcceptString :
"P2020293212" "Choose Tom Bowden"
// IntroSendoffString :
"P791831819" "Tom is very focused, and he knows what he is doing."
// IntroduceOneContact :
"P3711123174" "I have a new <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_INTRODUCE>contact</A> for you."
// IntroduceTwoContacts :
"P1049461347" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_INTRODUCE>Some people</A> I know want to meet you."
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


