// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Virginia Hoffman 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P65127026" "Virginia Hoffman"
// ProfessionString :
"P4162829788" "Artist"
// DescriptionString :
"P3411010969" "Virginia Hoffman is an avant-garde artist whose abstract paintings and performances always elicit a flurry of mixed reviews. She's also one of the most sought after representational sculptors in the city, as she specializes in creating statues of retiring heroes. Her work adorns many a public park, but her real passion is experimental painting and sculpture. She's in touch with both the city's cultural underground and its heroes, which puts her in a position to hear a lot she's probably not supposed to. Luckily, she's a good-hearted soul and always passes on information about criminal activities to her hero friends."
// WrongAllianceString :
// HelloString :
"P462503028" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>Ready to get your hands dirty?</A>"
// HelloString :
"P3525563704" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>I have some projects for you.</A>"
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P2437524961" "Nah, I'm booked. Why not go see what {LastContactName} is up to?"
// FirstVisitString :
"P3890262270" "As long as you don't ask me where I get my information, we'll get along fine."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P2881692440" "You're a sweetie, but I don't have a single project for you. Go see one of your other contacts."
// PlayerBusyString :
"P1311777447" "Take it from me, {HeroName}, there's such a thing as too many projects."
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P1727597580" "I've heard some interesting rumors, but I'd rather discuss them when you reach Security Level {Level}."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P2760258858" "I am starting to think you are a diamond in the rough, my friend. I've got some <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>new Enhancements</A> that might give you just the edge you need. And remember, you've got my number!"
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P4200553377" "I am convinced. You are fine art. Don't hesitate to look through all my <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>Enhancements.</A>"
// FailsafeLevelString :
"P629252383" "You have been a great project, but it's time to start on a new piece."
// LocationString :
// IntroString :
"P184775782" "You'd never guess it to look at her, but the sculptor Virginia Hoffman really knows a lot about what's going on in this town, especially with the Tsoo and the Circle of Thorns. You should talk to her. Ms. Hoffman lives in Steel Canyon these days."
// IntroAcceptString :
"P420100636" "Choose Virginia Hoffman"
// IntroSendoffString :
"P1855749465" "Virginia is very eccentric, but she has a good heart and is really interested in doing the right thing."
// IntroduceOneContact :
"P3548973349" "I think it's time for you to meet one of my <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_INTRODUCE>friends.</A>"
// IntroduceTwoContacts :
"P782963800" "You are ready to meet a <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_INTRODUCE>couple people</A> I know."
