// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Vitaly Cherenko 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P2469894209" "Vitaly Cherenko"
// ProfessionString :
"P3976011580" "Mystic Healer"
// DescriptionString :
"P1762295704" "Vitaly Cherenko thinks of himself as a doctor, though he practices magic, not medicine. Vitaly is a powerful mystic who uses his prodigious healing powers to treat the homeless, free of charge. His standard of living is not much better than his clientele's, but he is fulfilled and happy. That is, until he runs across a problem he can't cure with his magic. Then he turns to the city's heroes. Heroes comprise a large portion of his patients as well, especially the younger ones just starting out. Vitaly is currently quite worried about the Tsoo and the amoral Circle of Thorns, both of which threaten his homeless patients."
// WrongAllianceString :
// HelloString :
"P3750977760" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>These people need more help than I can provide.</A>"
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P4255140543" "I'm very sorry, but I have a number of patients to see right now. I think {LastContactName} has some time free, though."
// FirstVisitString :
"P617510182" "This city is in need of a great deal of healing. "
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P4041248739" "Your great skills would be wasted around here, {HeroName}. You should ask one of your other contacts for a job."
// PlayerBusyString :
"P2935468256" "You should complete some of the work you've started. I can't afford to let this task get lost in the shuffle."
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P1668305062" "I have to watch out for your safety. I can't give you another job until you reach Security Level {Level}."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P2713002459" "You have done a great deal to impress me, friend. Check out the <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>new charms</A> I have for you in my store. Call me whenever you can."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P453442559" "Your heroic actions prove you worthy of my trust. My most <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>powerful spells</A> are at your disposal."
// FailsafeLevelString :
"P1821592731" "It is with a heavy heart that I must send you to other sources of information."
// LocationString :
// IntroString :
"P130373803" "Have you ever met Vitaly Cherenko, the mystic healer? He's a walking hospital, only he uses magic instead of bandages. You should talk to him and see if you can help each other defeat the Tsoo and the Circle of Thorns. Vitaly can usually be found in Skyway City."
// IntroAcceptString :
"P1823291159" "Choose Vitaly Cherenko"
// IntroSendoffString :
"P2279111944" "Many people don't understand the work Vitaly is doing, but that doesn't mean it's not important."
// IntroduceOneContact :
"P2922312230" "There is <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_INTRODUCE>another</A> who could use your help."
// IntroduceTwoContacts :
"P2278020087" "May I suggest some <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_INTRODUCE>others</A> who need your help?"
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


