// Name :
"P1923981399" "Warren Trudeau"
// ProfessionString :
// DescriptionString :
"P2054850816" "Warren Trudeau is new to the FBI, but not to law enforcement. He served with distinction as an MP in the Marine Corps for years before moving on to the FBI Academy in Quantico. Paragon City is his first assignment as a field agent, an honor seldom bestowed on new recruits. He's a professional, driven man and takes his job very seriously. Trudeau's main duty is to work with local agencies and heroes to combat the Tsoo, and so far he's doing a fine job."
// WrongAllianceString :
// HelloString :
"P3558424960" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>My sources tell me bad things are about to happen.</A>"
// HelloString :
"P3013117103" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>I've got some leads for you.</A>"
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P3196343234" "I'm sorry, I'm quite busy at the moment. Anyway, {LastContactName} needs you right away."
// FirstVisitString :
"P1903632659" "I look forward to your assistance, {HeroName}."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P2532404565" "You should ask one of your other contacts for a lead, {HeroName}; I'm fresh out."
// PlayerBusyString :
"P3277861662" "You shouldn't be looking for more jobs when you're already overworked."
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P246718409" "Tell you what. Go out, get to Security Level {Level}, and then we'll chat."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P4278937351" "Trust is a difficult thing in this business, friend, but you are starting to earn mine. Let's see if the bureau can spare any <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>Enhancements</A> for a helpful hero like you. Here's my private number. Call me."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P2727545905" "You are the best partner I have had in this fight, {HeroName}. I want you to have all the <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>best Enhancements</A> in my store."
// FailsafeLevelString :
"P834527434" "Sorry, I have been assigned to other heroes."
// LocationString :
// IntroString :
"P2836536095" "FBI Special Agent Warren Trudeau would like to have a word with you. He's particularly eager to work with new heroes like you in combating the Tsoo and the Council. Agent Trudeau is on special assignment to Skyway City."
// IntroAcceptString :
"P3319846287" "Choose Warren Trudeau"
// IntroSendoffString :
"P2820695775" "I think you will find Agent Trudeau to be very helpful."
// IntroduceOneContact :
"P4101734550" "I think it's time for me to introduce you to <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_INTRODUCE>someone</A> I work with."
// IntroduceTwoContacts :
"P2147514863" "It's time for you to meet a couple more of my <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_INTRODUCE>associates.</A>"
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


