// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P228855090" "Wyatt Anderson"
// ProfessionString :
"P2847376745" "Historian"
// DescriptionString :
"P2729947319" "Most citizens are deeply concerned with Paragon City's future, but Wyatt Anderson is more interested in its past.  His books chronicle the history of the brave men and women who have protected the city through the decades. Lately, his research has taken on a more journalistic approach, and his most recent articles deal with current events in the context of the city's rich and complex history. His expertise has also earned him a reputation as a villain profiler. His encyclopedic knowledge of past threats often gives him a lot of insight into the current ones. He loves to work closely with heroes, and counts many among his friends."
// WrongAllianceString :
// HelloString :
"P1710527841" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>We've got a serious problem.</A>"
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P2856386973" "Actually, I'm pretty busy. Maybe you should talk to {LastContactName}."
// FirstVisitString :
"P721073211" "I look forward to chronicling your exploits."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P729739664" "Our work together is the stuff of the past, {HeroName}. You should help one of your other contacts instead."
// PlayerBusyString :
"P2058480610" "Looks like you already have your work cut out for you."
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P840150039" "I'm not sure my next mission is safe for you. Best to wait until you reach Security Level {Level}."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P4024493387" "My friend, you have shown yourself to be reliable and trustworthy. A source tipped me off to some <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>new Enhancements</A> for my store.  If there is anything I can do for you, my cell phone is always on."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P3059695208" "I think it's time for me to open up my archives to you fully, along with my <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>store.</A>"
// FailsafeLevelString :
"P1868931347" "It's time for your story to move off my pages and into the streets of Paragon City."
// LocationString :
// IntroString :
"P2306679658" "There's a great young historian you should talk to named <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Wyatt Anderson.</A> He's an expert on the history of all things super-powered, and he can be a big help to new heroes like you. He's especially interested in taking down the Clockwork and the Trolls. Wyatt's research has him in Steel Canyon these days."
// IntroAcceptString :
"P4165421557" "Choose Wyatt Anderson"
// IntroSendoffString :
"P1582823551" "Wyatt has a wealth of information."
// IntroduceOneContact :
"P2045127508" "There is <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_INTRODUCE>someone</A> I want you to meet."
// IntroduceTwoContacts :
"P2665373142" "I want to introduce you to some of my <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_INTRODUCE>other contacts.</A>"
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

